      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "今天认识了三个人，比我想的容易。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc048_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "大家也觉得你很好聊。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc048_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "开始的时候我还是有点儿不知道说什么。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc048_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "走起来以后就自然了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc048_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "因为可以直接聊看到的东西。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc048_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "对，一起做事比坐着硬找话题容易。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc048_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我还发现大家说话速度不一样。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc048_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "听多了就会习惯不同的人。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc048_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "有一个人说得很快，我请他慢一点儿。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc048_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "很好，这比假装听懂更好。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc048_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "以前我可能会点头然后不说话。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc048_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "现在你更敢表达自己的需要了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc048_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对。我觉得这也是语言学习的一部分。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc048_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "当然，沟通不是考试。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc048_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "今天这句话我也记住了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc048_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "下次你可以自己邀请他们喝咖啡。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc048_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这个对我来说是下一步挑战。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc048_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "慢慢来，你已经进步很快了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
